s3-3-p5 : Block
s3-3-p5 = prose (cons "An execution history composes such steps with matching endpoints, finitely or by guarded continuation. An observation may retain its final state, event sequence, or scalar result; the observation map specifies exactly which historical distinctions it forgets. Whether a retained state suffices for subsequent behavior depends on the continuation and its observations, not on the name assigned to that state. Equivalent presentations of complete histories transport dependent constructions by univalence." nil)
